BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:English Conversation Circle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260909T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260909T191500
UID:6a80af09aafa6100295cd737@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Practice speaking English with a friendly group\, led by a lib
 rarian. Meet new people\, improve your English language conversation skill
 s\, and build your confidence in a fun and relaxed setting. This program i
 s for those whose first language is not English. This is a drop-in program
 \, registration is not required.
LOCATION:Maria A. Shchuka\, First floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a80af09aafa6100295cd737
X-SOURCE:Volunteer Toronto
END:VEVENT
